o and taxis. The project features 1, 2 and 3 BHK apartments with various amenities like gymnasium, swimming pool, parks, club house, library, mini-theatre, kids play area, etc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#34;,&#34;location&#34;:{&#34;location&#34;:{&#34;lat&#34;:&#34;19.2160935&#34;,&#34;lng&#34;:&#34;72.8657211&#34;}},&#34;id&#34;:&#34;ztKBDB2&#34;,&#34;url&#34;:&#34;/projects/rivali-park-wintergreen-ztKBDB2&#34;,&#34;__v&#34;:0,&#34;price&#34;:{&#34;zeroTo25Lacs&#34;:0,&#34;twentyfiveTo50Lacs&#34;:0,&#34;fiftyTo1cr&#34;:0,&#34;oneTo5cr&#34;:1,&#34;fiveToabove&#34;:0,&#34;min&#34;:40000000,&#34;max&#34;:40000000},&#34;updatedAt&#34;:&#34;2022-12-01T13:14:43.061Z&#34;,&#34;views&#34;:2708,&#34;total_properties&#34;:1,&#34;authortiy_url&#34;:&#34;/authorities/municipal-corporation-of-greater-mumbai-(mcgm)-bmc-uuonAy3&#34;});">
